---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import Catalogue from "../studio/Catalogue";
---

<Site title="Firmware releases">
  <section class="wrap page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">CHOOSE WHAT YOUR DEVICE CAN DO</p>
    <h1>Firmware releases</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      Firmware is the software that runs on your board. Choose what it can do.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each build is made for an exact board and a set of features, such as
      networking or audio. Recommendations are specific to a board and profile.
      A profile is a particular combination of those build options. You can
      review older milestones deliberately; a newer build is never installed
      automatically.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap section compact">
    <Catalogue client:load />
  </section>
</Site>
